      </div>
      <div class="mo-services-grid">
        <div class="mo-service-card">
          <div class="mo-service-icon"><i class="ti ti-eyeglass"></i></div>
          <h3>Kids Eyewear</h3>
          <p>For a child with a high prescription, getting the right fit is critical for visual development and overall confidence.</p>
          <a href="https://mimsoptique.com/pediatric-eyewear/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mo-service-link">Learn More <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
        <div class="mo-service-card">
          <div class="mo-service-icon"><i class="ti ti-eye"></i></div>
          <h3>High Prescription Specialist</h3>
          <p>If you have a high prescription, you know that ordinary opticians often result in thick, heavy, or distorted lenses.</p>
          <a href="https://mimsoptique.com/high-prescription-specialist/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mo-service-link">Learn More <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
        <div class="mo-service-card">
          <div class="mo-service-icon"><i class="ti ti-tool"></i></div>
          <h3>Frame Restoration</h3>
          <p>Don't toss out those beloved frames — restore them! Meticulous frame restoration and repair services for vintage and designer eyewear.</p>
          <a href="https://mimsoptique.com/frame-restoration/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mo-service-link">Learn More <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
        <div class="mo-service-card">
          <div class="mo-service-icon"><i class="ti ti-accessibility"></i></div>
          <h3>Low Vision Device Expert</h3>
          <p>Low vision can make daily life a challenge, but it doesn't have to limit your independence.</p>
          <a href="https://mimsoptique.com/low-vision-device-expert/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mo-service-link">Learn More <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
