        <p class="mo-team-bio">With over 20 years of dedicated experience in the optical industry, Sheebana is a highly skilled and compassionate optician committed to delivering exceptional patient care and personalized service. Her passion for eye care began in her teenage years and has continued to grow throughout her accomplished career.</p>
        <p class="mo-team-bio" style="margin-top: 12px;">She has extensive expertise in vision correction, eyewear fitting, and the latest advancements in optical technology. She takes pride in helping patients achieve clear vision while finding eyewear that complements both their lifestyle and personal style — ensuring every individual leaves feeling confident, comfortable, and well cared for.</p>
        <a href="https://mimsoptique.com/about/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mo-btn-gold" style="margin-top: 8px;">Read More</a>
